11
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:21,840
Ethan now helps other companies improve their growth trajectories through workshops, coaching and as a tra trusted advisor on the podcast, we talked with Sean and Ethan about the importance of a North Star metric, optimizing for speed to value, and why product market fit needs to be dialed in over time.

12
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:25,360
Hey Sean and Ethan, thank you so much for being on the podcast.

13
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:36,000
I wanted to kick things off and just hear the story of how the two of you met and started podcasting together seem a bit like the odd couple to be kicking off a podcast together.

14
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,120
So I'm really curious.

15
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,400
Yeah, thanks for having us on.

16
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,560
We're really excited to be on the subclub podcast.

17
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,240
We're both fans and yeah.

18
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:52,720
Yeah, we have the Breakout Growth podcast, but Sean and I actually met more than twenty years ago at uproar dot com, where I believe Sean's title was VP of Marketing.

19
