00:44:43,360 --> 00:44:55,120
I think, uh, as Sean was saying, when you look at your value delivery engine, obviously getting more people to those aha moments rapidly and meaningfully, is going to be really important.

413
00:44:55,360 --> 00:45:08,240
And if you can look for ways to take out friction between those points, I think it's going to improve your odds of turning people into white hot fans who love what you do and want to stay engaged.

414
00:45:08,960 --> 00:45:21,440
